  abstract = {In the following, I focus on one particular challenge: the integration of affective computing and multimedia information extraction. Critical Technical Challenges What are the critical technical challenges in multimedia information extraction (MMIE)? Work by Picard and others has created considerable awareness for the role of affect in human computer interaction. As key ingredients of affective computing Picard identifies recognizing, expressing, modelling, communicating, and responding to emotional information (Picard 2003). In the context of information extraction, methods of affective computing can be applied to enhance classical information extraction tasks by emotion and sentiment detection. In addition, the experience of users},
}

